  "alternative_titles": "Boku no Kawaii Musume wa Futago no Kenja: Tokugi ga Debuff no Teihen Kuro Madoushi, Sodateta Futago no Musume ga S-Rank no Dai Kenja ni Natteshimau, 僕のかわいい娘は双子の賢者　～特技がデバフの底辺黒魔導士、育てた双子の娘がＳランクの大賢者になってしまう～, My Lovely Daughters are Both Sages: I'm a Black Mage Whose Special Skill is Debuffing, and the Twin Daughters I Raised Become S-Ranked Great Sages!, Boku no Kawaii Musume wa Futago no Kenja",
